# Faculty & Dept Head Dashboard UI Updates

Comprehensive UI overhaul for Faculty and Department Head dashboards, including live room status visualization, calendar improvements, reports redesign, academic year management, class schedule editing, and removing student COR upload dependency.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a **large** change set spanning ~15 files across frontend and potentially 1-2 new backend endpoints. I recommend we implement this in **phases** so you can review and test progressively. The backend DB schema is **NOT being changed** — all features work with existing tables.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> **Phase-by-phase approach:** Given the scope (~8 distinct features), I suggest we batch these into 3-4 phases to avoid a single massive commit. Please confirm if you'd prefer all-at-once or phased.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **New backend endpoints needed:** While you said "only understand current design without changing the backend", some features (live room occupancy dots, academic year settings) will require **new API endpoints** since no existing endpoint returns real-time room occupancy or stores academic year config. I'll keep these minimal and consistent with the current FastAPI/SQLAlchemy patterns. Please confirm this is acceptable.

> [!CAUTION]
> **Schedule edit ticket system:** The feature to send edit requests (modify class modality/time/day) as tickets for dept head approval is a new workflow. This requires a **new DB table** (`schedule_change_requests`) or reusing `audit_logs`. Since you said not to change the backend schema, I propose we defer this to a follow-up, OR I can add a lightweight new table. Please advise.

---

## Phase 1: Dashboard Live Status + Date/Time Display

### Faculty Dashboard

#### [MODIFY] [FacultyDashboardPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/FacultyDashboard/FacultyDashboardPage.jsx)
- **Replace** [LiveClassStatus](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/FacultyDashboard/FacultyDashboardPage.jsx#160-193) component ("Today's Classes" with list items) with new **"Live Status"** component
- New component shows a box the same size as the current one, with:
  - Title: "Live Status" (replaces "Today's Classes")
  - Room number on **top-right** of the box
  - Small **green dots** (scattered) = students/faculty currently present (have `ENTRY` or `BREAK_IN` action as latest)
  - Small **yellow dots** = people currently on break (`BREAK_OUT` as latest)
  - **Bottom-center**: count of present + on-break
- Add **current date/time** display at the top of the dashboard
- Polls the new backend endpoint every 10 seconds for live data

#### [MODIFY] [FacultyDashboardPage.css](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/FacultyDashboard/FacultyDashboardPage.css)
- Add CSS for Live Status dot visualization, animations, room label

