### Dept Head Dashboard

#### [MODIFY] [DeptHeadDashboardPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/DeptHeadDashboard/DeptHeadDashboardPage.jsx)
- **Replace** existing "Today's Classes" with **"Live Status"** section
- Two view modes:
  - **Wide View**: Shows ALL classrooms (e.g., Room 326, Room 322) side-by-side as separate boxes. Each box has room number top-right, green/yellow dots, and present/break count at bottom-center
  - **Single View**: Dropdown to select 1 classroom to focus on (same concept, larger)
- Toggle/tab to switch between "Wide View" and single classroom view
- Add current date/time display

#### [MODIFY] [DeptHeadDashboardPage.css](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/DeptHeadDashboard/DeptHeadDashboardPage.css)
- Add CSS for multi-room grid, dot visualization, view toggle

