### Backend (New Endpoint)

#### [MODIFY] [faculty.py](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/backend/api/routers/faculty.py)
- Add `GET /api/faculty/live-room-status/{user_id}` — returns for each room the faculty teaches in:
  - Room name, list of people with their latest action (ENTRY/BREAK_OUT/BREAK_IN/EXIT)
  - Counts of present and on-break
- Add `GET /api/faculty/live-room-status-all/{department_id}` (for dept head) — returns status for ALL rooms in the department's classes
- Both endpoints query `attendance_logs` for today's latest action per person per class, joined with `classes` for room info

