## Phase 4: Academic Year Settings + Student Schedule from DB

### Academic Year (Dept Head)

#### [MODIFY] [DeptHeadManagePage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/DeptHeadDashboard/DeptHeadManagePage.jsx)
- Add **Academic Year Settings** section:
  - Set start month and end month of academic year
  - Display current A.Y. (e.g., "2025-2026, August → May")
  - Save to database (uses `classes.academic_year` field or a new config)
  - Faculty cannot edit this — only dept head
- Calendar limit based on A.Y. dates

### Student Schedule from DB

#### [MODIFY] [SchedulePage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/iska/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/FRAMESCAPSTONE/frontend/src/components/StudentDashboard/SchedulePage.jsx)
- **Remove COR upload section** — students no longer upload COR
- Schedule is **auto-populated from the database** (from `enrollments` → `classes` → `subjects`)
- The `GET /api/student/schedule/{id}` endpoint already returns data from enrollments, so this is mostly a frontend change to remove the upload UI and show "Your schedule is automatically synced" message instead

