## Phase 5: Schedule Edit Ticket System (Deferred — Needs User Input)

> [!WARNING]
> This requires a new DB table or workflow. **Deferred** pending your feedback on whether to add a `schedule_change_requests` table.

- Faculty can request edits to class modality, time, day
- Sent as ticket to dept head
- Dept head approves/rejects → notification to faculty
- Reflected in database upon approval

